# Go
services/dispatch/dispatch

# Feature 9 (deliverable-submission) local file storage — actual uploaded
# content, not reproducible build output, so it gets its own entry rather
# than reusing dist/.
apps/api/var/

# Feature 15 (cocos-personal-office) — Playwright's own run-report scratch
# directory (`e2e/office.spec.ts`'s `playwright.config.ts`), regenerated on
# every `pnpm exec playwright test` invocation, never hand-edited.
test-results/

# scripts/local-env's runtime manifest + service logs (Task A, phase1-real-
# user-flow-repair) — generated by `pnpm env:start`, never hand-edited or
# committed; this is the single source of truth for the one-command local
# environment, deliberately NOT the shared root .env. Anchored to the repo
# root (`/local-env/`, not `local-env/`) — the unanchored form also matched
# `scripts/local-env/`, which is real source code, not runtime state (Codex
# review would have caught this; caught it first via `git status` showing
# the whole scripts/local-env/ source directory as untracked-and-ignored).
/local-env/

# Feature 19 (ctr-online-learning), T-1910 — `services/dispatch-rerank/`
# (Python, uv-managed, design.md 决策 5) is not in the pnpm/Go workspace and
# manages its own virtualenv/caches; `openapi.json` and Node's
# `rerank-types.generated.d.ts` are the real generated artifacts and ARE
# committed (design.md's own stated preference — reviewable contract diffs).
services/dispatch-rerank/.venv/
services/dispatch-rerank/.pytest_cache/
services/dispatch-rerank/.ruff_cache/
services/dispatch-rerank/**/__pycache__/
services/dispatch-rerank/*.egg-info/
